# Old, unsanitized case-study drafts and Sanity exports. They live outside
# the repo in ../promptatwork-private/Docs/; these paths are local symlinks
# to it so the /case-study skill and scripts/check-content.ts,
# push-draft.ts and fetch-content.ts keep working. No trailing slash: git
# sees a symlink as a file.
/Docs/content-drafts
/Docs/backups
